1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,800
Ever find yourself stuck doing something you actively hate?

2
00:00:03,800 --> 00:00:06,660
Here is why quitting feels impossible:

3
00:00:06,660 --> 00:00:11,400
in your brain, liking and wanting are two completely separate systems.

4
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:14,140
Liking is the actual pleasure you feel,

5
00:00:14,140 --> 00:00:16,600
powered by fragile opioid hotspots.

6
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:19,520
Wanting is the raw urge to pursue,

7
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:20,800
driven by dopamine.

8
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:24,740
Over time, the pleasure hotspots shut down from tolerance.

9
00:00:24,740 --> 00:00:27,020
But dopamine pathways do the opposite—

10
00:00:27,020 --> 00:00:28,800
they become hyper-sensitized.

11
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:31,350
Your brain screams that you need it,

12
00:00:31,350 --> 00:00:34,000
even while the experience gives you zero joy.

13
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:36,380
You are not chasing pleasure anymore.

14
00:00:36,380 --> 00:00:38,191
You are trapped in wanting.
